{"/api/discogs/artist/162616/profile":{"cached":true,"profile":{"id":"162616","image":"https://i.discogs.com/q_ZMmeaaYNpCLvh8GuV0yP6B4fJPHkDrGyfB--sLl1g/rs:fit/g:sm/q:90/h:600/w:600/czM6Ly9kaXNjb2dz/LWRhdGFiYXNlLWlt/YWdlcy9BLTE2MjYx/Ni0xNzExMTgxNzcw/LTE1ODMucG5n.jpeg","imageThumb":"https://i.discogs.com/9oXXPcUv3ApDeh0F-8s6XyUtybif_hdSelDAm2A0h6o/rs:fit/g:sm/q:40/h:150/w:150/czM6Ly9kaXNjb2dz/LWRhdGFiYXNlLWlt/YWdlcy9BLTE2MjYx/Ni0xNzExMTgxNzcw/LTE1ODMucG5n.jpeg","profile":"Ismael Miranda a.k.a. El Niño Bonito de la Salsa (The Pretty Boy of Salsa) (born February 20, 1950 in Aguada, Puerto Rico) is a composer and a singer of salsa music.","provider":"discogs","ref":"discogs:artist:162616","relations":{"aliases":null,"groups":[{"active":true,"id":15794,"name":"Fania All Stars"},{"active":false,"id":134109,"name":"Joey Pastrana And His Orchestra"},{"active":true,"id":288875,"name":"Orchestra Harlow"},{"active":true,"id":388115,"name":"Ismael Miranda Y Su Orquesta Revelación"}],"members":[{"active":true,"id":387518,"name":"Carlos De Leon"}],"namevariations":["I. Miranda","Ismael Miranda Jr.","Ismael Miranda Y Su Orquesta Revelación","Maestro Ismael Miranda","Miranda","i. Miranda"]},"schemaVersion":2,"sourceUrl":"https://www.discogs.com/artist/162616-Ismael-Miranda","type":"artist","urls":["http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ismael_Miranda"]}},"/api/discogs/artist/19215/profile":{"cached":true,"profile":{"id":"19215","image":"https://i.discogs.com/lB-e4lcE8OSavkykS5w1r_Z7ZmTW7xE8WrFn71QC7Kc/rs:fit/g:sm/q:90/h:366/w:300/czM6Ly9kaXNjb2dz/LWRhdGFiYXNlLWlt/YWdlcy9BLTE5MjE1/LTE1ODY0MjEzNDQt/MTg3NC5qcGVn.jpeg","imageThumb":"https://i.discogs.com/qoFqjn_ruOXpoHidCtQjAbT7ZowMZNmoNW0K_RqgUNI/rs:fit/g:sm/q:40/h:150/w:150/czM6Ly9kaXNjb2dz/LWRhdGFiYXNlLWlt/YWdlcy9BLTE5MjE1/LTE1ODY0MjEzNDQt/MTg3NC5qcGVn.jpeg","profile":"UK garage and house producer, remixer and DJ from Birmingham.\nFounder and managing director of [l=Urban Dubz], [l=Love House Records] and [l=Garage Paradise (2)].\nAs well as his famed solo work, Jeremy Sylvester claims a huge backlist of remixes and has been a regular collaborator with many established dance producers. He also previously dabbled in jungle-drum n bass production in the early 90's before his more permanent venture into mid-tempo dance music. Jeremy is known almost as well for the number of aliases he uses as he is for the quality of his output.\nJeremy has had a big musical background since he was a child. His first encounters were through his father ([a1079377]), a member of [a211778] a successful disco band in the late seventies.\nUnable to satisfy his eagerness to further his career in music, Jeremy contacted [a3236234] in the mid 90's and started to produce tracks for FX Promotions (Nice 'N' Ripe) under tens of aliases and groups.","provider":"discogs","ref":"discogs:artist:19215","relations":{"aliases":[{"id":18307,"name":"Groove Connektion"},{"id":19347,"name":"Strickly Dubz"},{"id":28113,"name":"J & S"},{"id":38711,"name":"Electronica"},{"id":54585,"name":"Miles Fontaine"},{"id":58404,"name":"Sylvester (2)"},{"id":59240,"name":"Pure Orange"},{"id":61845,"name":"Urban Dubz"},{"id":71293,"name":"Playaz"},{"id":80412,"name":"Latin Connektion"},{"id":96352,"name":"Champagne Bubbler"},{"id":101860,"name":"Jazz Mondo"},{"id":133487,"name":"Groove Committee (2)"},{"id":135398,"name":"The Hornet"},{"id":145450,"name":"Undercover Trax"},{"id":148154,"name":"Freak Da' Funk"},{"id":155963,"name":"Deep Cover Inc"},{"id":173284,"name":"G.I. Sly"},{"id":183840,"name":"Big J (3)"},{"id":192283,"name":"Phat Kat Inc"},{"id":195425,"name":"Socafrica"},{"id":196401,"name":"Strike Force (2)"},{"id":196699,"name":"M.F. Project"},{"id":203235,"name":"Sly (4)"},{"id":204342,"name":"Tweaker Pimps"},{"id":224415,"name":"Dub Foundation (2)"},{"id":230913,"name":"Off The Hook"},{"id":261367,"name":"24/7"},{"id":279792,"name":"Darkus (3)"},{"id":387110,"name":"En'Lock"},{"id":1014447,"name":"Trampas"},{"id":1454783,"name":"JCS"},{"id":145483